; secur32.dll import surface for the Promise Windows zero-dependency link
; surface (T0772). Provides the SSPI entry points the SChannel TLS backend
; drives (T1598, compiler/internal/codegen/pal/tls_windows.go). secur32.dll
; ships with every Windows install and name-exports (or forwards) all of these.
; See kernel32.def header. Regenerate import libs with: bin/release winlink
LIBRARY secur32.dll
EXPORTS
AcceptSecurityContext
AcquireCredentialsHandleA
ApplyControlToken
DecryptMessage
DeleteSecurityContext
EncryptMessage
FreeContextBuffer
FreeCredentialsHandle
InitializeSecurityContextA
QueryContextAttributesA
